      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I was actually just thinking a temporary block/hide avatar would be highly useful where it only lasts for as long as they are in that instance or until it is manually turned off. You have my vote regarding a temporary mute as there are situations where that would definitely be useful as well.\n\nEven the ability to focus on a user you are talking to where it temporarily mutes everyone else that is not been toggled to be 'in focus' would be handy.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
